WEBVTT

00:18:29.613 --> 00:18:32.068
And the good news is,
you can keep going like that.

00:18:32.092 --> 00:18:34.372
Every hour of the day,
every day of your life,

00:18:34.396 --> 00:18:35.804
all the way to your deathbed,

00:18:35.828 --> 00:18:38.781
which will now be 10 years later
than it would have otherwise.

00:18:39.081 --> 00:18:42.239
And when you get there, more than likely,

00:18:42.263 --> 00:18:45.779
you will not have
any of those top five regrets,

00:18:45.803 --> 00:18:48.652
because you will have built up
the strength and resilience

00:18:48.676 --> 00:18:51.359
to lead a life truer to your dreams.

00:18:52.136 --> 00:18:55.375
And with 10 extra years,
you might even have enough time

00:18:55.399 --> 00:18:57.318
to play a few more games.

00:18:57.342 --> 00:18:58.421
Thank you.

00:18:58.445 --> 00:19:00.900
(Applause)